WEBVTT

00:11:55.803 --> 00:12:00.294
are inextricably woven
into the history of life on this planet.

00:12:00.989 --> 00:12:04.156
And I think I'm a little wrong
when I say that life is a mystery,

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.891
because I think that life
is actually an open secret

00:12:06.915 --> 00:12:10.899
that has been beckoning our species
for millennia to understand it.

00:12:11.344 --> 00:12:12.945
So I ask you:

00:12:12.969 --> 00:12:16.742
Aren't we the best chance
that life has to know itself?

00:12:17.053 --> 00:12:18.204
And if so,

00:12:18.228 --> 00:12:19.958
what the heck are we waiting for?

00:12:20.368 --> 00:12:21.569
Thank you.

00:12:21.593 --> 00:12:24.847
(Applause)